==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|strāle}}, from {{inh|de|goh|strāla}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|[[*strēlaz]], [[*strēlō]]||arrow, ray, beam}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|[[*strēl-]], [[*strēlā-]]||arrow, beam}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|straal}}, English {{m|en|streal}}.

